{"seq":3,"slug":"mod-version-compat","title":"版本兼容","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-modding-ugc/ecosystem/mod-version-compat","wordCount":1537,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"版本兼容\">版本兼容</h1><p>每个有 mod 社区的游戏，发补丁时都会经历同一场灾难：游戏更新一推送，论坛瞬间炸锅——「更新后所有 mod 都崩了」。天际每次大版本更新，依赖 SKSE 的 mod 集体失效；玩家因此学会了「关闭自动更新、锁死游戏版本」。版本兼容研究的就是：游戏不可避免地要演进，怎么才能不在每次更新时把存量 mod 全部打废。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>版本兼容的根本矛盾是「游戏要往前走，mod 要原地不动」。游戏每次更新都可能改动三样东西，任何一样都能让老 mod 失效：API 契约（函数签名/语义变了）、数据 schema（存档/资源格式变了）、二进制布局（内存偏移变了，原生 mod 直接崩）。兼容性管理就是给这三类变更分别建立「契约 + 演化规则 + 迁移路径」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[游戏发布更新] --&gt; B{变更类型}&#10;    B --&gt; C[API 变更]&#10;    B --&gt; D[Schema 变更]&#10;    B --&gt; E[二进制布局变更]&#10;    C --&gt; F{破坏性?}&#10;    F --&gt;|否 MINOR/PATCH| G[老 mod 继续工作]&#10;    F --&gt;|是 MAJOR| H[老 mod 失效&lt;br/&gt;需迁移]&#10;    D --&gt; I[版本化 schema&lt;br/&gt;迁移器升级数据]&#10;    E --&gt; J[原生 mod 必崩&lt;br/&gt;需重编译/重定位]&#10;    H --&gt; K[提供迁移指南/工具]&#10;    I --&gt; K&#10;    J --&gt; K&#10;    K --&gt; L[社区更新 mod]&#10;    G --&gt; M[平滑过渡]&#10;    L --&gt; M\">flowchart TD\n    A[游戏发布更新] --&gt; B{变更类型}\n    B --&gt; C[API 变更]\n    B --&gt; D[Schema 变更]\n    B --&gt; E[二进制布局变更]\n    C --&gt; F{破坏性?}\n    F --&gt;|否 MINOR/PATCH| G[老 mod 继续工作]\n    F --&gt;|是 MAJOR| H[老 mod 失效&lt;br/&gt;需迁移]\n    D --&gt; I[版本化 schema&lt;br/&gt;迁移器升级数据]\n    E --&gt; J[原生 mod 必崩&lt;br/&gt;需重编译/重定位]\n    H --&gt; K[提供迁移指南/工具]\n    I --&gt; K\n    J --&gt; K\n    K --&gt; L[社区更新 mod]\n    G --&gt; M[平滑过渡]\n    L --&gt; M</pre><p>不同档位的 mod 受版本变更的冲击差异极大。下表把 <a href=\"../foundations/data-vs-code-mods\">数据型与代码型 Mod</a> 那条能力谱映射到版本脆弱性。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>mod 档位</th>\n<th>对 API 变更</th>\n<th>对 schema 变更</th>\n<th>对二进制变更</th>\n<th>整体脆弱性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>纯数据</td>\n<td>不受影响</td>\n<td>需 schema 迁移</td>\n<td>不受影响</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构化数据</td>\n<td>不受影响</td>\n<td>敏感</td>\n<td>不受影响</td>\n<td>低–中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>声明式逻辑</td>\n<td>节点契约变才影响</td>\n<td>敏感</td>\n<td>不受影响</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>沙箱脚本</td>\n<td>敏感</td>\n<td>敏感</td>\n<td>不受影响</td>\n<td>中–高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原生代码</td>\n<td>敏感</td>\n<td>敏感</td>\n<td>极敏感（必崩）</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"语义化版本-把承诺写进版本号\">语义化版本：把承诺写进版本号</h2><p>兼容性的第一道工具是版本号本身。沿用 <a href=\"../extension/mod-api-design\">Mod API 设计</a> 立下的 semver 契约：<code>MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH</code>，主版本变更才允许破坏兼容。游戏在每次发布时清晰声明这次属于哪一档，mod 作者和管理器据此判断是否需要更新。</p>\n<p>兼容性判定可形式化为版本区间检查。设 mod 声明它支持的游戏版本区间为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[v_{\\min}, v_{\\max})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，当前游戏版本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则该 mod 被判为兼容当且仅当：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_{\\min} \\le v_g &lt; v_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8252em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>成熟的 mod 平台会用这个区间做「软门禁」：游戏升到区间外时，管理器不直接禁用 mod，而是警告玩家「此 mod 未针对当前版本测试」，把决定权交还玩家。这比硬性禁用更人性——很多 mod 实际上跨版本仍能工作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"schema-演化-让老数据活过格式变更\">Schema 演化：让老数据活过格式变更</h2><p>数据型 mod 和存档都依赖数据 schema，而 schema 几乎一定会演化——新版本给物品加了字段、改了枚举值。处理它的标准手段是版本化 schema + 迁移器：每份数据带版本号，加载时若版本落后，依次跑迁移函数把它升级到当前版本。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"MIGRATIONS = {&#10;  1: lambda d: {**d, &quot;rarity&quot;: &quot;common&quot;},   # v1→v2: 新增 rarity 默认值&#10;  2: lambda d: rename_field(d, &quot;hp&quot;, &quot;health&quot;),  # v2→v3: 字段改名&#10;}&#10;def migrate(data):&#10;    while data[&quot;schema_version&quot;] &lt; CURRENT:&#10;        data = MIGRATIONS[data[&quot;schema_version&quot;]](data)&#10;        data[&quot;schema_version&quot;] += 1&#10;    return data\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">MIGRATIONS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d: {</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rarity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"common\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># v1→v2: 新增 rarity 默认值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d: rename_field(d, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"health\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># v2→v3: 字段改名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> migrate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"schema_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> CURRENT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MIGRATIONS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[data[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"schema_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]](data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        data[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"schema_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这套「带版本号、按链迁移」的机制与存档系统完全同源——事实上 mod 数据和存档常共用一套序列化设施。schema 演化的纵深，跨库见 <a href=\"../../game-save-serialization/formats/schema-evolution\">模式演化</a>，本篇只强调一条 mod 特有的纪律：迁移必须是向后兼容的纯增量，绝不能删字段或改语义，否则装了旧 mod 的玩家存档会被你的迁移器毁掉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"二进制脆弱性-原生-mod-为何必崩\">二进制脆弱性：原生 mod 为何必崩</h2><p>能力谱最右端的原生代码 mod（如 SKSE 扩展、ASI 注入），其脆弱性是另一个量级。它们直接 hook 游戏的内存地址、调用游戏的内部函数——而这些地址和函数布局，编译器每次重编都会变。游戏一更新，所有硬编码的偏移全部失效，原生 mod 必崩，无可挽回。</p>\n<p>这正是主流游戏只对脚本 mod 提供官方兼容承诺、把原生 mod 划为「玩家自担风险」的根本原因（见 <a href=\"../foundations/data-vs-code-mods\">数据型与代码型 Mod</a> 的档位划分）。原生 mod 社区的应对是引入「地址库」中间层——把硬编码地址换成可更新的符号表，游戏更新后只需更新地址库、不必重编每个 mod。但这本质是社区在用工程手段对冲一个无法根除的脆弱性。原生 mod 与游戏内存的耦合，也使它与 <a href=\"../../game-anti-cheat-security/clientside/memory-integrity\">反作弊</a> 的内存完整性检测天然冲突——两者都在抢同一块内存的写权限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"弃用与迁移-负责任地做破坏性变更\">弃用与迁移：负责任地做破坏性变更</h2><p>破坏性变更有时不可避免，关键是怎么做得「负责任」。成熟做法是给一个弃用窗口：旧 API 标记为 deprecated 但仍可用一到两个版本，期间打印警告、文档给出迁移指南，到期才真正移除。这给社区留出更新 mod 的时间，避免「一夜之间全崩」。</p>\n<p>设游戏版本以速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 演进、mod 社区平均需要时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 跟进迁移，则弃用窗口长度应满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W \\ge \\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>——窗口短于社区跟进时间，就必然有大批 mod 在窗口内来不及更新而失效。这条简单不等式解释了为什么频繁推破坏性变更的游戏 mod 生态总是脆弱：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 太高、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 太短，社区永远追不上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>版本兼容的根本矛盾是「游戏要演进、mod 要不动」，三类变更会打废老 mod：API 契约、数据 schema、二进制布局。</li>\n<li>mod 越靠能力谱右端越脆弱：纯数据几乎免疫，原生代码对二进制变更必崩。</li>\n<li>用 semver + 版本区间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[v_{\\min}, v_{\\max})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 做兼容判定，平台宜用「软门禁」警告而非硬禁用。</li>\n<li>schema 演化靠版本化数据 + 按链迁移器，纪律是「纯增量、不删字段不改语义」，与存档系统同源。</li>\n<li>原生 mod 因硬编码内存偏移必随更新崩溃，社区用「地址库」对冲，且与反作弊内存检测天然冲突。</li>\n<li>破坏性变更要给弃用窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W \\ge \\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>（社区跟进时间），窗口太短则 mod 生态必然脆弱。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>脆弱性源于能力档位：<a href=\"../foundations/data-vs-code-mods\">数据型与代码型 Mod</a></li>\n<li>semver 契约的源头：<a href=\"../extension/mod-api-design\">Mod API 设计</a></li>\n<li>更新如何牵连依赖图：<a href=\"mod-dependencies\">依赖与加载顺序</a></li>\n<li>跨库：schema 演化的序列化纵深：<a href=\"../../game-save-serialization/formats/schema-evolution\">模式演化</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"版本兼容","id":"版本兼容"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"语义化版本：把承诺写进版本号","id":"语义化版本-把承诺写进版本号"},{"level":2,"text":"Schema 演化：让老数据活过格式变更","id":"schema-演化-让老数据活过格式变更"},{"level":2,"text":"二进制脆弱性：原生 mod 为何必崩","id":"二进制脆弱性-原生-mod-为何必崩"},{"level":2,"text":"弃用与迁移：负责任地做破坏性变更","id":"弃用与迁移-负责任地做破坏性变更"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"依赖与加载顺序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-modding-ugc/ecosystem/mod-dependencies"},"next":{"title":"Mod 安全与沙箱逃逸","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-modding-ugc/practice/mod-security"}}